      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm really deep into the biohacking scene right now and trying to optimize my micronutrient levels for peak athletic performance. i've been feeling some pretty significant fatigue lately which is messing with my training cycles, and i'm pretty sure my ferritin levels are suboptimal. i want to do an aggressive iron loading protocol to fix this fast so i can get back to 100%. what would a high-performance iron optimization regimen look like for someone trying to maximize absorption and get results quickly?",
